<%- include('partials/head') %><header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BIG PICTURE</p><h1>Your pay, clearly.</h1><p>A little more clarity on what comes in and what goes out.</p></div><a class="button" href="/upload">＋ Import payslip</a></header>
<div class="metric-grid"><section class="metric primary"><p>Latest take-home pay <span>↗</span></p><h2><%= gbp(latest?.net_pay) %></h2><small><%= latest?'Paid '+date(latest.pay_date):'Your next chapter starts with an import' %></small></section><section class="metric"><p>Latest gross pay</p><h2><%= gbp(latest?.total_payments) %></h2><small>Before deductions</small></section><section class="metric"><p>Latest deductions</p><h2><%= gbp(latest?.total_deductions) %></h2><small>Tax, pension & other deductions</small></section></div>
<div class="overview-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YEAR AT A GLANCE</p><h2>Your earnings</h2></div><span class="badge"> <%= year==='all'?'All years':year+' / '+(Number(year)+1) %></span></div><%- include('partials/filter') %><p>Grouped by printed pay date. Tax years run from 6 April to 5 April. Totals include saved payslips only.</p><% if(Number(count)){ %><p class="notice error"><%= count %> imports still need attention across all years. Annual totals may be incomplete. <a href="/imports">Review imports</a></p><% } %><div class="year-totals"><div><small>Total take-home</small><strong><%= gbp(data.reduce((s,p)=>s+Number(p.net_pay),0)) %></strong></div><div><small>Gross earnings</small><strong><%= gbp(data.reduce((s,p)=>s+Number(p.total_payments),0)) %></strong></div><div><small>Payslips</small><strong><%= data.length %></strong></div></div><% if(data.length){ %><div class="bars" aria-label="Take-home pay by payslip"><% const max=Math.max(...data.map(p=>Math.abs(Number(p.net_pay))),1); data.slice(0,12).reverse().forEach(p=>{ %><div class="bar-item"><meter min="0" max="<%= max %>" value="<%= Math.abs(Number(p.net_pay)) %>" title="<%= date(p.pay_date) %>: <%= gbp(p.net_pay) %>"><%= gbp(p.net_pay) %></meter><small><%= new Date(p.pay_date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{month:'short',timeZone:'UTC'}) %></small></div><% }) %></div><% } %></section><section class="panel sync-card"><p class="eyebrow">WORKING IN THE BACKGROUND</p><div class="sync-symbol">↻</div><h2>Your payslips, in sync.</h2><p><%= nextcloud?'Nextcloud imports new and changed PDFs automatically.':'Connect Nextcloud to bring new payslips into your workspace automatically.' %></p><div class="status-line"><span class="status-dot"></span><%= nextcloud?(state?.error?'Sync needs attention':'Nextcloud configured'):'Not connected' %></div><p class="muted"><%= count %> import<%= Number(count)===1?'':'s' %> need attention</p><a class="button secondary" href="/imports">View imports <span>→</span></a></section></div>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PAPER TRAIL</p><h2>Recent payslips</h2></div><a href="/payslip_table">View library →</a></div><%- include('partials/slips',{data:data.slice(0,5)}) %></section><%- include('partials/foot') %>
